atures and field\\nshapes and serialize only successfully constructed validated models. Error\\nmessages never include the rejected string, mapping key, or credential.\\n\\n\\n\\nDetails:\\n- Implement only this task's named boundary; other contract entries supply read-only context, not writable scope.\\n- Re-check the acceptance premise before editing; retain independent regression coverage if already fixed.\\n\\nAcceptance criteria:\\n- Re-check that direct observations accept invalid scalars before editing; if already fixed, skip production edits and report while retaining independent tests. `mise exec -- uv run pytest tests/events/test_unicode_safety.py -k scalar` passes; cases cover lone high/low surrogates in identifiers, values and nested keys, ordinary Unicode and valid escaped pairs, with explicit rejected/accepted assertions.\\n\\nVerify: mise exec -- uv run pytest -q --tb=line tests/events/test_unicode_safety.py\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"src/ovcaq/events/model.py\",\n        \"CHANGELOG.md\"\n      ],\n      \"blocked_by\": [],\n      \"estimated_tokens\": 65586,\n      \"est_context_peak\": 85586,\n      \"model\": \"opus\",\n      \"tier_reason\": \"contract\",\n      \"qwen_eligible\": false,\n      \"qwen_excluded_reason\": \"tier\",\n      \"id\": \"1\",\n      \"status\": \"completed\",\n      \"attempts\": [\n        {\n          \"attempt\": 1,\n          \"model\": \"opus\",\n          \"actual_model\": \"gpt-6.1-sol\",\n          \"actual_provider\": \"openai\",\n          \"outcome\": \"completed\",\n          \"review_cycle\": null,\n          \"cause\": null,\n          \"implementor\": \"codex\",\n          \"preflight_outcome\": null,\n          \"pipeline\": \"full\",\n          \"self_deslop\": \"skipped:trivial\",\n          \"style_gate\": \"clean\",\n          \"split_hygiene\": \"clean\",\n          \"devon\": \"exploit_fixed\",\n          \"devon_weak_points\": 8,\n          \"devon_exploit\": \"Finite scalar fixtures allowed