tes the entry from the state being closed (`cycles` = `cycle`; `autonomous_decisions` = count of `autonomous_decisions` entries the batch report's \"Autonomous Decisions\" table renders - dicts whose `type` is not `\"assumed-ambiguity\"` and whose Issue cell holds text (the first non-empty string among issue / question / finding / decision / supersedes / detail), per `render_report.is_autonomous_row`; `escalated_decisions` = count of `deferred_decisions` entries whose `status` is neither `\"pending\"` nor `\"deferred\"`, mirroring `render_report._is_pending`'s exclusion rule exactly; `tasks_completed`/`tasks_total` copied as-is) and resets `batch.parks_consecutive` to 0 in the same write. |\n/Users/bob/.claude/plugins/cache/buvis-plugins/autopilot/0.9.0/skills/run-autopilot/references/state-schema.md:435:When a decision is made through the research-then-decide path, the `research` field is added to the decision entry (in either `autonomous_decisions` or `deferred_decisions`):\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
