+`${CLAUDE_PLUGIN_ROOT}` reference to `/Users/bob/.claude/plugins/cache/buvis-plugins/autopilot/0.9.0`. Personal skills continue to
+resolve through `~/.agents/skills`. Read missing plugin skills from the installed
