ts were left untouched.\n\nValidation used `UV_CACHE_DIR=/private/tmp/ovcaq-uv-cache`:\n\n- Own-file Ruff format/check passed.\n- Initial named pytest run: exit 1, 2 failed before meaningful execution because sandbox restrictions denied production `ps`.\n- First escalated named run: exit 1, 1 passed / 1 failed. A spy initially treated normal post-exit process-group-anchor cleanup as premature child termination. Approved process-method inspection established the distinction; the assertion now checks actual child liveness when a signal is sent.\n- Final `uv run pytest tests/runtime/test_unicode_continuity.py -q --tb=line`: exit 0, **2 passed**, 2 warnings, 0.38s. Warnings concern pytest cleanup of existing temporary garbage directories.\n\nNo network or live-provider calls. Reads stayed within the listed anchors, skills, and subsequently approved process-method anchors; total input remained below 100K. No blockers remain.\n\nASSUMPTIONS: none\n\nFILES_TOUCHED:\ntests/runtime/test_unicode_continuity.py\ndocs/dev/tmp/ivan-4-output.md\n\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
