s, later valid identity/usage and terminal evidence, remains alive until its normal exit, and leaves exact raw plus reloadable normalized evidence; a forced genuine normalized writer failure still aborts through the established runtime path. Re-check that R7/R2 premises remain before edits; if already fixed, retain independent regression coverage and report rather than force churn.\\n\\nVerify: mise exec -- uv run pytest -q --tb=line tests/runtime/test_unicode_continuity.py\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"tests/runtime/test_unicode_continuity.py\"\n      ],\n      \"blocked_by\": [\n        2,\n        3\n      ],\n      \"estimated_tokens\": 58241,\n      \"est_context_peak\": 78241,\n      \"model\": \"opus\",\n      \"tier_reason\": \"floor\",\n      \"qwen_eligible\": false,\n      \"qwen_excluded_reason\": \"tier\",\n      \"id\": \"4\",\n      \"status\": \"pending\"\n    },\n    {\n      \"name\": \"Document normalized Unicode and bounded detail safety\",\n      \"description\": \"Document normalized Unicode and bounded detail safety\\n\\nLocation: /Users/bob/git/src/github.com/buvis/ovcaq/docs/driver-protocol.md, /Users/bob/git/src/github.com/buvis/ovcaq/CHANGELOG.md\\n\\nReuse: Existing model constructors and sanitizer, raw-first framing/preview, native bounded_detail call sites and test-only supervisor harness; use only the boundaries relevant to this task.\\n\\nContract (verbatim \\u2014 design Interfaces & contracts; target paths anchored to repository root):\\nThe documentation must accurately distinguish recoverable input gaps from\\nfatal evidence/publication failures, state that invalid native strings are\\nchecked before driver mutation, and describe control removal before redaction\\nand bounding. Add Unreleased Fixed changelog entries; no version bump.\\n\\n\\nDetails:\\n- Implement only this task's named boundary; other contract entries supply read-only context, not writable scope.\\n- Re-check the acceptance premise before editing; retain independent regression coverage if already fixed.\\n\\nAcceptance criteria:\\n- `mise exec -- uv run pytest tests/runtime/test_unicode_continuity.py` passes; a temporary fake child emits unsafe native records, later valid identity/usage and terminal evidence, remains alive until its normal exit, and leaves exact raw plus reloadable normalized evidence; a forced genuine normalized writer failure still aborts through the established runtime path. Re-check that R7/R2 premises remain before edits; if already fixed, retain independent regression coverage and report rather than force churn.\\n\\nVerify: Check documentation against the implemented safety boundaries and Unreleased Fixed entries.\",\n      \"files\": [\n        \"docs/driver-protocol.md\",\n        \"CHANGELOG.md\"\n      ],\n      \"blocked_by\": [\n        4\n      ],\n      \"estimated_tokens\": 66355,\n      \"est_context_peak\": 86355,\n      \"model\": \"opus\",\n      \"tier_reason\": \"floor\",\n      \"qwen_eligible\": false,\n      \"qwen_excluded_reason\": \"tier\",\n      \"id\": \"5\",\n      \"status\": \"pending\"\n    }\n  ],\n  \"tasks_total\": 5,\n  \"work_start_sha\": \"e4d765c42d1be7b42c27312e8a5f474d61178b52\",\n  \"repo_root\": \"/Users/bob/git/src/github.com/buvis/ovcaq\",\n  \"contract_card\": \"step: build / task 1 Tess in progress\\ninvariants: statectl sole writer; one task per dispatch; full per-task gates; no same-session completion review\\nnext: quality gate, commit tests, Devon, red-check, Ivan, narrow verify, style and Pat; then tasks 2\\u20135 and full verification\\nwork_start_sha: e4d765c42d1be7b42c27312e8a5f474d61178b52\\ncache: UV_CACHE_DIR=/private/tmp/ovcaq-uv-cache\"\n}\n\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
