ncio_mode = \"auto\"` in `[tool.pytest.ini_options]` to drop the per-test marker.\n- Use `@pytest_asyncio.fixture` for async fixtures in strict mode.\n\n","exit_code":0,"duration":{"secs":0,"nanos":1958}},"started_at_ms":1791622312946,"completed_at_ms":1791622312946}}
