t:85:   drain, retry, and failure decisions derive from committed state plus a\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:86:   normalized session result. A final agent message is never authoritative.\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:87:3. **Provider code stays at the edge.** Claude/Codex argv, environment variables,\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:88:   event formats, model names, rate-limit parsing, and connectivity checks live\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:89:   under their adapter. Shared runtime and UI code must not parse provider-native\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:90:   events.\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:91:4. **Raw evidence survives normalization.** Preserve each session's raw output.\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:92:   Normalizers are tolerant and must degrade to an unknown/raw observation\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:93:   instead of crashing the supervisor.\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:94:5. **The TUI observes shared models.** It reads state, registry, metrics, and\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:95:   normalized observations. It does not implement lifecycle policy or maintain a\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:96:   second liveness algorithm.\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:97:6. **External capabilities stay external.** Provisioning invokes a launcher's\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:98:   supported marketplace/plugin CLI and verifies the result. It does not copy\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:99:   plugin contents into this package or hand-edit launcher caches.\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:100:7. **No shell evaluation of configured commands.** Store agent commands as argv\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:101:   arrays and spawn them without `shell=True`.\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:102:\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:103:## Target layout\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:104:\ndocs/dev/tmp/di