:60:\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:61:The global `AGENTS.md` remains in force. This file adds project-specific rules.\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:62:\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:63:## Current state\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:64:\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:65:The repository is in planning/bootstrap. Until an implementation PRD replaces\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:66:it, `docs/dev/project-management/plans/implementation-plan.md` is the architecture and sequencing\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:67:authority. Do not create production modules opportunistically outside that\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:68:sequence.\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:69:\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:70:## Product boundary\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:71:\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:72:OVCAQ core owns state, lifecycle commands, process supervision, agent adapters,\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:73:normalized events, observability, the TUI, and launcher provisioning checks.\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:74:\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:75:OVCAQ core does **not** contain launcher-specific skills, agents, hooks, or\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:76:plugins. Those live in external marketplaces. Core may carry declarative\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:77:identifiers and version requirements needed to reconcile them.\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:78:\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:79:## Architecture invariants\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:80:\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:81:1. **One state writer.** Every durable `state.json` mutation goes through the\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:82:   state store. Agents mutate state only through `ovcaq state` or a higher-level\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:83:   OVCAQ command. Never instruct an agent to edit `state.json` directly.\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:84:2. **State decides; prose does not.** Session completion, phase handoff, pause,\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:85:   drain, retry, and failure decisions derive from committed state plus a\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:86:   normalized session result. A final agent message is never authoritative.\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:87:3. **Provider code stays at the edge.** Claude/Codex argv, environment variables,\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:88:   event formats, model names, rate-limit parsing, and connectivity checks live\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:89:   under their adapter. Shared runtime and UI code must not parse provider-native\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:90:   events.\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:91:4. **Raw evidence survives normalization.** Preserve each session's raw output.\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:92:   Normalizers are tolerant and must degrade to an unknown/raw observation\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:93:   instead of crashing the supervisor.\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:94:5. **The TUI observes shared models.** It reads state, registry, metrics, and\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:95:   normalized observations. It does not implement lifecycle policy or maintain a\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:96:   second liveness algorithm.\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:97:6. **External capabilities stay external.** Provisioning invokes a launcher's\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:98:   supported marketplace/plugin CLI and verifies the result. It does not copy\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:99:   plugin contents into this package or hand-edit launcher caches.\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:100:7. **No shell evaluation of configured commands.** Store agent commands as argv\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:101:   arrays and spawn them without `shell=True`.\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:102:\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:103:## Target layout\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:104:\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:105:```text\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:106:src/ovcaq/\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:107:  state/        # schema, transactions, compound mutations\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:108:  workflow/     # PRD selection, transitions, records, policy\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:109:  runtime/      # supervisor, decisions, registry, process ownership\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:110:  drivers/      # Claude, Codex, and generic command adapters\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:111:  events/       # normalized event model and session reduction\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:112:  tui/          # discovery and Textual/Rich presentation\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:113:  provision/    # marketplace/plugin reconciliation\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:114:tests/          # mirrors package boundaries; provider JSONL fixtures\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:115:docs/           # tracked architecture and operator documentation\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:116:```\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:117:\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:118:## Toolchain\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:119:\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:120:- Python 3.12+ managed through `mise`.\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:121:- `uv` for environments, locking, build, and command execution.\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:122:- `pytest` for tests; `ruff` for formatting/linting; `mypy` for package types.\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:123:- Keep the runtime dependency set small. Textual/Rich are justified by the TUI;\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:124:  prefer the standard library for state, locking, configuration, and subprocesses.\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:125:\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:126:Planned verification commands once the scaffold lands:\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:127:\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:128:```bash\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:129:uv sync --all-groups\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:130:uv run pytest\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:131:uv run ruff check .\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:132:uv run ruff format --check .\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:133:uv run mypy src/ovcaq\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:134:uv build\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:135:```\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:136:\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:137:## Development rules\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:138:\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:139:- Characterize current behavior before moving it from `~/.claude`.\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:140:- Extract state first, then pure workflow logic, runtime, adapters, TUI, and\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:141:  provisioning in that order.\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:142:- Sanitized Claude and Codex JSONL fixtures belong in `tests/fixtures/`; tests\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:143:  never read live files from `~/.claude` or `~/.codex`.\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:144:- Test process-group, lock, and signal behavior with real subprocesses in\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:145:  addition to unit tests.\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:146:- Documentation for commands comes from the same command registry/parser as the\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:147:  implementation; do not maintain a second hand-written verb inventory.\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:148:- Keep provider-neutral modules free of the strings `claude`, `anthropic`,\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:149:  `codex`, and provider model identifiers except in tests that enforce this rule.\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:150:- Use conventional commits. No compatibility shim, dual writer, or rollback\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:151:  framework is required for the initial cutover.\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:152:\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:153:## Migration stance\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:154:\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:155:This is a one-way early-stage extraction. Start a fresh OVCAQ batch/state tree;\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:156:do not build an importer for the current `docs/dev/project-management/autopilot/state.json` unless\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:157:a later requirement explicitly needs it. Temporary delegation during a local\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:158:canary is acceptable, but do not ship `autoclaude`, `autopilot`, `tracon`, or\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:159:`statectl` aliases as permanent public APIs.\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:160:\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:161:Relevant read-only surfaces: tests/drivers/test_codex_detail_safety.py; src/ovcaq/drivers/codex.py only bounded_detail/classify_failure/failure_reset call-site anchors; src/ovcaq/events/model.py sanitize_text anchors. Implement only codex_events.py and CHANGELOG.md, no tests. Reading budget: codex_events.py lines1–66 (bounded_detail); use rg anchor for any other needed named symbols rather than full large files. Keep existing classification/reset semantics unchanged. Use Python patterns skill /Users/bob/.agents/skills/python-patterns/SKILL.md. Narrow verify only tests/drivers/test_codex_detail_safety.py with cache /private/tmp/ovcaq-uv-cache. Report docs/dev/tmp/ivan-3-output.md. No state/commits.\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:162:\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:163:\\ndocs/dev/tmp/dispatch-ivan-3-final.txt:164