+{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01TVm1DMfiZhBfBMpkikoHc3","type":"tool_result","content":"5620\tdiff --git a/docs/dev/project-management/autopilot/reports/00051-build-evidence.md b/docs/dev/project-management/autopilot/reports/00051-build-evidence.md\n5621\tnew file mode 100644\n5622\tindex 0000000..13d90b4\n5623\t--- /dev/null\n5624\t+++ b/docs/dev/project-management/autopilot/reports/00051-build-evidence.md\n5625\t@@ -0,0 +1,76 @@\n5626\t+# PRD 00051 build evidence\n5627\t+\n5628\t+Repair sources: PRD 00009 cycle 2 R7 (unsafe Unicode publication) and R2 (control-split credential fragment crossing the detail cap). Historical findings and deferred records remain intact. Build work does not establish full-review closure.\n5629\t+\n5630\t+## Task 1\n5631\t+\n5632\t+Recovered committed implementation b3175de and prior independent test commits a537309, 3e2a46b, 4719234. Prior raw session 4c23a27209ee43eea65aca95bd80e5d1 and native worker rollouts correlate Tess/Ivan dispatches to OpenAI gpt-6.1-sol; requested logical tier opus/high. Actual model fields use observed worker turn_context metadata, not launcher or coordinator identity.\n5633\t+\n5634\t+Narrow recovery verification: `env UV_CACHE_DIR=/private/tmp/ovcaq-uv-cache mise exec -- uv run pytest -q --tb=line tests/events/test_unicode_safety.py` -> exit 0, 957 passed in 0.23s. Prior raw evidence records clean style and split-hygiene gates. Implementation commit net size was 29 lines across two files, satisfying the trivial self-deslop skip. Pat output parsed successfully; its three LOW findings (per-character scan cost, cyclic-container nontermination outside the acyclic JSON contract, repeated test tables) remain for full review, without an implementation retry under the LOW-only rule. Devon proved eight weak points; strengthened tests retained their rejection assertions and valid controls. The fixture correction preserved existing credential redaction.\n5635\t+\n5636\t+R7 remains open at native frame/supervisor boundaries until tasks 2 and 4 and the fresh completion review establish closure. R2 remains open pending task 3 and fresh review.\n5637\t+\n5638\t+## Task 2 premise\n5639\t+\n5640\t+Tess's pre-edit public RawFirstDecoder probe reproduced startup with an ignored invalid scalar: it emitted session.started and changed adapter identity from null to poisoned-thread while retaining exact raw bytes. This confirms rejection must precede adapter mutation.\n5641\t+\n5642\t+## Task 2 recovery (2026-10-10)\n5643\t+\n5644\t+Retained partial preflight plus bounded native Ivan continuation dispatch 88705a21. Observed worker turn_context: gpt-6-astra/high (OpenAI), after prior opus context_overrun and concrete unresolved focused failures; logical tier opus preserved. The worker changed only parser exception handling to ValueError/RecursionError and identified a fixture blocker. Tess dispatch 052a95f0 (observed gpt-6.1-sol/high) added explicit zero cache-write input to the healthy synthetic completion, preserving every assertion; 250 focused cases passed. Tests committed 8d53aad; production e2f26b6. Existing native usage policy unchanged.\n5645\t+\n5646\t+Four-check fixture quality review: behavioral names, genuine durable/semantic assertions, error/boundary cases, no implementation tautologies. Mechanical tautology and fixture style gates clean. Task full style gate reports RawFirstDecoder._complete 52 lines; one bounded style dispatch 8b7d88dc pending. Pat prompt 807562cd prepared but never dispatched because correction must precede review. Self-deslop skipped:trivial (implementation net 9 lines, 2 files). Prior Devon ran once, no passing exploit, but eight attempts violated its three-failure stop rule; historical deviation retained, never presented as eight proven weaknesses.\n5647\t+\n5648\t+Task 2 gate closure: b46d9e9 moved raw-gap construction outside the tolerant catch into a dedicated helper; style recheck clean; split hygiene clean. Pat (Sonnet/high, tool-free) returned two MEDIUM scope claims and two LOW observations. Both MEDIUM claims are false: the canonical state task explicitly allows events/tail.py and CHANGELOG.md, and the coordinator-authorized separate test file avoided the original file exceeding 800 lines. Pre-edit R7 proof is retained above (startup mutates identity) and red-check-2.txt. Pat received Tess-specific description rather than the canonical production task; retain raw review and this input-selection defect for full review. No claim that the acceptance suite was already run: final phase verification remains mandatory. LOW nested-catch/double-parse and test branching findings retained. Native primary recovery model gpt-6-astra; contributing partial implementation/style/test models remain separate observed evidence for the audit.\n5649\t+\n5650\t+Pat corrected-input continuation ceec6c1b received canonical production task plus documented premise and split permission; parsed output has LOW only. The first raw output remains preserved. Acceptance-file coverage must be confirmed in final full-suite evidence, not inferred from narrow 250-case run.\n5651\t+\n5652\t+## Task 3\n5653\t+\n5654\t+Pre-edit exact R2 cap probe returned 4096 characters ending in sk-abcdefghijkl; redaction false. Tess 9e3966b3 wrote helper/error/turn-failed/rate/lane normalized JSONL cases; one quality retry d095ed43 replaced shared-production classification oracle with independent fixed expectations (authentication, permission, connectivity, timeout, unknown before control removal). Each authored run: 14 failed, 22 passed, with two pytest cleanup warnings. Mechanical shape and style gates clean; manual four-check gate preserves behavior names, real payload/byte assertions, cap/control/reset edges and independent oracles. Test commit 40e4aee. Receiver fixture/API clarifications came from existing public tests, no implementation files supplied to Tess. Devon f5dea3de dispatched once; outcome pending.\n5655\t+\n5656\t+Devon task3 f5dea3de proved eight passing exploits (each 36 passed, exit0): literal credential whitelist, lost suffix, x-only cap, dropped newline, dropped tab, Bearer bypass, OSC bypass, and dropped short text. All original production bytes restored; SHA256 f308ed6b63d0e706b866d32b9f05d6df0cc02f5051de117949c9a0c807418646. Full wrong functions and exact output retained in docs/dev/tmp/devon-3-output.md. Tess strengthening80f1d04e must answer all eight; no second Devon dispatch.\n5657\t+\n5658\t+Tess80f1d04e answered all eight weaknesses as strengthened; no in-contract dismissals or missing numbered points. Strengthened tests committed6d8e2b9; coordinator red-check18failed66passed, proving restored existing behavior still fails. Shape/style gates clean. Source R2 remains under repair until implementation and fresh review; no token in these tests is a real credential.\n5659\t+\n5660\t+Task3 implementatione9f21f7 from Ivan447f65fc (observed native gpt-6.1-sol/high, OpenAI) passes84focused cases. Controls removed on full original string, sanitize_text runs next,4096cap last. Classification/reset paths unchanged. Reflow, style and split gates clean; self-deslop skipped:trivial (net2lines,2files). Ivan reported initial cat/no-timeout read deviations before prompt prohibition visible; later anchored search and narrow test used60/300second subprocess budgets; retained, not treated as compliance proof. Pat62e2d96d pending.\n5661\t+\n5662\t+Pat task3 parsed LOW-only output. Retained concerns about expected-string assertions and receiver-cap exact-value oracle for full review. Dropping y-boundary rows is contradicted by Devon candidate3 proving x-only cap bypass; preserve these independent regression cases. No correctness/security defect reported.\n5663\t+\n5664\t+## Task 4\n5665\t+\n5666\t+Ivan7c69386f native OpenAI gpt-6.1-sol/high authored test-only real-subprocess coverage, committed dd0b86c. Initial restricted run failed before meaningful execution because production ps was denied; approved exact-command retry retained. First approved run:1passed1failed due overstrict cleanup spy; source-method inspection established post-exit group-anchor cleanup is inert to the exited child. Final independent liveness-aware assertions:2passed, existing cleanup warnings retained. No real inference/network. Tests retain exact raw bytes, reloadable gap/healthy/terminal evidence, healthy usage and zero-return normal-exit sentinel. Separate injected normalized gap writer EIO propagates identical exception, cleans actual live PID, suppresses normal sentinel and retains raw/failure summary. Existing genuine failure tests untouched. Style gate flagged111/59line functions; bounded single style dispatch a2610e60 pending. self_deslop skipped:test-only; Pat skipped:test-only outside rework.\n5667\t+\n5668\t+Task4 bounded style fix0be8e4c preserves27assertions and exact wire bytes;2passed, style/split/reflow clean. Initial test commit omitted the pre-commit reflow invocation (untracked file has no reflow hunks); record this procedural deviation. No claims of full-review closure.\n5669\t+\n5670\t+## Task 5\n5671\t+\n5672\t+Ivan a12a9adf native OpenAI gpt-6.1-sol/high aligned protocol against scalar checks, raw preflight, fatal publication/process-control path and control→redaction→bound ordering. Corrected coordinator nonexistent native_events anchor to drivers/codex_events.py:57. Existing Fixed entries retained plus distinct runtime continuity/publication cleanup entry, no version bump. Static source/document consistency and scoped diff check passed; focused runtime acceptance already2passed in task4. Reflow clean; self_deslop skipped:trivial (net20lines); style clean/no Python; split skipped:no-tests; Pat skipped:docs-only. Fresh full completion review remains pending for both source R7/R2.\n5673\t+\n5674\t+## Final verification (first run)\n5675\t+\n5676\t+Settled code HEAD9e39537. uv sync --all-groups exit0; ruff check . exit1 (PT014 incorrectly